":"你已经解锁了所有的刻印位。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a09ea55c3439ad3c7ca6245dc391551663f021e63efbf7ee0589d98a691257e7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8f8de68490b522c6e59d2b942b64f27c18e9fcd5d1e210f52e4ba95cb19d2c63","logical_entry_identity":"211e04d700f2a22bdd2879a10ebce93089a0588d5d4639b0120571f9cd430a37","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"In the aftermath of the Spellblaze, the Thaloren had to defend their forests against foes and fires alike. Many of the trees died despite the efforts of the Elves to save them. Their wood was fashioned into a bow to be wielded against the darkness.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在魔法大爆炸的余波里，自然精灵不得不从敌人和大火中保卫他们的森林。尽管精灵们奋力的抢救它们，许多树还是死掉了。它们的遗体被打造成一张弓用来抵御黑暗的侵袭。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"64b80c784841ea1c6a5c97675b2f6e1723e08d732fdc44292664cc1708f3ef9e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8f8e7f54af56a847c4649853d2d56a4edd24d15c636615c50c475824aaceeacf","logical_entry_identity":"60173b66af9ebde324ea02d97a1f9e9fa2275648e3a5ee8d285b87f591f963b9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Level 50","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"50级"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"88c2ed8004d8e42076bae56a08635b3c7fa433f26562fee7804f7947d44f1588","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8f9002efa22707902071e2795c9fc98952a7d6110db38c339cd8b8622cf29e4f","logical_entry_identity":"d12137774e79ec0048f52302ee7dbc10543287a8e577f37dd49e9f5be93650e3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Alchemical control over lightning energies.","source_tag":"_t","target":"操控闪电能量的炼金法术。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0a59a2385bc02c35f916a2dfe9fd14fae42cc2d27dbe564e90205e2feb8fd570","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8f90d21507ea0ce4aa8f2c3526e27821a8d57457ff4f85319af1665f201515b2","logical_entry_identity":"33aafe0e64f47749f30b38b25a22d7bdd7bb19f4d8b3294ad6bfda2a8fe63ae3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Lua inspect [Trap]","source_tag":"_t","target":"在 Lua 中查看 [陷阱]"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7d09360e85667bd6a65a94ef5477f3670993ce27ef7745936e4106cdfd322bc9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8f99f40a043ff3c8a4e8ad4847f4617546b523c8368bb516bb2c110fbf7b4a6f","logical_entry_identity":"47236954b0f11fb835051592a1ccbaf542bd5c46ae3717558c8068580317ba2e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sunder Armour","source_tag":"talent name","target":"破甲"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6968c3b9c75756a470ee378a46504efa5068ce5f864e2bd3788e03d52ef0855d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8f9d3f5776e51484e8f1db7b9517df527e98e74961664c2a70d530eab882ce36","logical_entry_identity":"6794db81e515160e28f0e905ee0d400225dea9e98ac46162e1a1aff041ae2007","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You peer into three possible futures, allowing you to explore each for %d turns.  When the effect expires, you'll choose which of the three futures becomes your present.\n\t\tIf you know Foresight you'll gain additional defense and chance to shrug off critical hits (equal to your Foresight values) while See the Threads is active.\n\t\tThis spell splits the timeline.  Attempting to use another spell that also splits the timeline while this effect is active will be unsuccessful.\n\t\tIf you die in any thread you'll revert the timeline to the point when you first cast the spell and the effect will end.\n\t\tThis spell may only be used once per zone level.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你窥视三种可能的未来，允许你分别进行探索 %d 回合。当效果结束，你选择三者之一成为你的现在。\n\t\t如果你学会了深谋远虑，当你使用命运螺旋时，将获得额外的闪避和暴击减免（数值等于深谋远虑的奖励）。\n\t\t这个法术会使时间线分裂。当此技能激活的时候，使用其他分裂时间线的技能将会失败。\n\t\t如果你在任何一条时间线上死亡，你将使时间线回到你使用技能的地方，并且技能效果结束。\n\t\t这个技能每个楼层只能使用一次。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aff83d5e064fcd23fb9c11c1209cfce27e2c8a52fcdd72a64be1a97fb4017343","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8fa0c581a2648dd9a4e61f791b27ee91298d73b39e51d3a9db6632c81c9b5289","logical_entry_identity":"ae1110a380338310d705c9edd390465c26d7a52d1f325699d43acf9c7507e5bc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Welcome #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#.\nYou have arrived in the Infinite Dungeon.\nYour life outside did not satisfy you, so you came here looking for adventure.\nWhile you know this is a one way trip, you hope to go in a blaze of glory!\n\nGo forth, venture into the depths of the dungeon and see how far you can get before the end.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎你 #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#！\n你来到了无尽地下城。\n外面的生活无法满足你，所以你到了这里寻求冒险。\n你很清楚，这是一条有去无回的道路，却希望能轰轰烈烈地结束这一生！\n\n向前去，进入地下城深处去冒险吧，看看在生命终点到来前你能走多远。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3a74fcf9d9251be164a6d558ac2db3b900e01e38f9104d653f1ca9c6a8ffc473","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8fa72e7371809d852fc7a3f133f319c439bf98994a24d9392480184dc8158a3d","logical_entry_identity":"19ae80f15fd74d1bc963c0f78d5f650ae123f746d938f62c30ef8c2e79036b04","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#VIOLET#You enter the swirling portal and in the blink of an eye you set foot in strange empty space...","source_tag":"log","target":"#VIOLET#你进入了传送漩涡，一眨眼功夫你发现你到了一个陌生的空地…"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1cc0975f00d9d91549708e0ad6b76d88bde7edbee77a5a1c4cdc5cf25ee25ce9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8facdf7e3da66813bfbe5df045beea0137739689ee57dffa6b4f6e81f656e67c","logical_entry_identity":"35d1db08a0b0226ba46bc08852817af898b27aa4e9ad4b7cbfc2be4ac4164d42","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" and gains %d defense","source_tag":"tformat","target":" 并增加 %d 点闪避值。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ea81c8147cbf5d512941e6ab32794936cd61b1bba1a8b63ae0df394964b36cb2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8fb0578688fbc33d374a253af56ca8778764a3bb20c9793bcbd98d67a0f80ae5","logical_entry_identity":"6ba1a42e324d264003a67190c8e495f67a042e719111d4bab36fedcf6a803531","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Spacetime Tuning","source_tag":"_t","target":"+时空调谐"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"52ed670b5d5a9265588ce271ce9c210ca146e66ead8e64de7746ac3b9923ca0a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8fb5445c08d